  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to social enterprises</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project will support the establishment of support structures for social enterprises. These structures will provide a range of services to social enterprises such as knowledge transfer and direct capacity-building support, formal and informal education and training, business coaching, organisation of events, sharing of office space or equipment.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
